Package: soapysdr0.8-module-hackrfduplex
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: soapysdr0.8-module
Description: SoapySDR module joining two HackRF One boards into one full-duplex radio
 One HackRF One only ever receives and the other only ever transmits, so a
 SoapySDR application sees a single device, driver key hackrfduplex, with
 an RX channel and a TX channel that run at the same time, each tuned,
 filtered and gained on its own. Both streams share one hardware time,
 found by a short calibration burst when they start, so transmissions can
 be placed at a receive timestamp. Works with stock HackRF firmware and
 libhackrf.

Package: hackrfduplex-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: soapysdr0.8-module-hackrfduplex (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: check tool for the hackrfduplex SoapySDR module
 hackrfduplex-check opens a pair of HackRF One boards through SoapySDR,
 receives, optionally transmits a tone or timed bursts, and reports
 rates, drops, levels, the time origin and where timed bursts landed.
 It transmits only when asked to.
